#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <acronym>CGI</acronym> slave provides a way to execute <acronym>CGI</"
"acronym> programs without the need to have a running web server. This can "
"for example be used for local testing of <acronym>CGI</acronym> programs or "
"for using search engines that only provide a <acronym>CGI</acronym> frontend "
"like the one from <application>Doxygen</application>."
msgstr ""
"O escravo <acronym>CGI</acronym> fornece dun mecanismo para executar "
"programas <acronym>CGI</acronym> sen precisar dun servidor web en execución. "
"Isto pode empregarse para, por exemplo, probar localmente programas "
"<acronym>CGI</acronym> ou para empregar motores de busca que só fornezan "
"unha interface <acronym>CGI</acronym> como a de <application>Doxygen</"
"application>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The slave implements the <command>cgi:</command> protocol. It uses the "
"filename from the given &URL; and searches a configurable list of folders."
msgstr ""
"O escravo implementa o protocolo <command>cgi:</command>. Emprega o nome do "
"ficheiro do &URL; dado e busca unha lista configurábel de cartafoles."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The list of folders can be retrieved using the command "
"<userinput><command>kde4-config</command> <option>--path cgi</option> </"
"userinput>. The value defaults to <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$<envar>HOME</envar>/.kde4/cgi-bin/</filename>."
msgstr ""
"A lista de cartafoles pode obterse mediante a orde <userinput><command>kde4-"
"config</command> <option>--path cgi</option> </userinput>. O valor "
"predeterminado é <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>HOME</envar>/.kde4/"
"cgi-bin/</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the &systemsettings; module <guilabel>CGI Script</guilabel> (launched "
"with <userinput><command>kcmshell4</command> <option>kcmcgi</option> </"
"userinput>) to add or remove additional user defined paths that are searched "
"for <acronym>CGI</acronym> scripts."
msgstr ""
"Use o módulo de &systemsettings; <guilabel>Script CGI</guilabel> (iníciase "
"con <userinput><command>kcmshell4</command> <option>kcmcgi</option></"
"userinput>) para engadir ou retirar rutas adicionais definidas polo usuario "
"nas que se busquen scripts <acronym>CGI</acronym>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this kioslave finds an executable with the given name it executes it, "
"passes the arguments of the &URL; and sets the environment variables needed "
"by <acronym>CGI</acronym> programs."
msgstr ""
"Se este kioslave atopa un executábel co nome dado execútao, pasa os "
"argumentos do &URL; e configura as variábeis de ambiente que requiran os "
"programas <acronym>CGI</acronym>."
